{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1278827-family-hunger-for-a-gargoyle-horror","id":1278827,"title":"Family/Hunger for a Gargoyle Horror","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-05T08:50:14-08:00","id":1278827,"title":"Family/Hunger for a Gargoyle Horror","content":"I was considering making a Beast character with a Gargoyle horror, would that be more of an Ugallu/Nemesis or Whisper; or an Eshmaki/Whisper?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T09:31:38-08:00","id":1278830,"title":"","content":"It depends on what you want to emphasize. What makes gargoyles scary? Considering the foundational myths, I think Punishment is probably the most suitable Hunger (or, if you go back even further, Ruin). Family is certainly up for interpretation: Eshmaki or Ugallu or even Namtaru would be fitting choices, so, again, it depends on what you want to emphasize and how you want to feed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-06T09:04:11-08:00","id":1278972,"title":"","content":"Throw us your character concept, that might help us helpi